  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Niue Strengthening Governance: Fale Fono Construction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity provides funding&#xa0;to the Government of Niue (GoN) to build a new&#xa0;Fale Fono&#xa0;and MFAT contracted&#xa0;professional quality assurance to the GoN on the quality of construction.
This Activity also provides DFAT funding for the completion of interior and exterior works to the Fale Fono.&#xa0; This funding is to be disbursed under&#xa0;the Niue Programme&apos;s Arrangement on Delegated Cooperation with DFAT in two payments.
It was officially opened in May 2022 and held its first session in July 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
